### Google login url
#Sử dụng URL 
GET https://accounts.google.com/o/oauth2/v2/auth/oauthchooseaccount?client_id=637359103193-umcet39e9b2k2kc0l369mlebantp1089.apps.googleusercontent.com&redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Faiquizizz.com%2Fauthentication%2Fgoogle%2Fcallback&response_type=code&access_type=offline&scope=openid%20email%20profile&prompt=consent&service=lso&o2v=2&flowName=GeneralOAuthFlow

# Sử dụng code ở trên để login
