### Google Login Test (Authorization Code Flow)
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/Users/GoogleLogin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "authorizationCode": ""
}

### Google Login for Mobile/SPA (without cookies)
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/Users/GoogleLogin?useCookies=false
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "authorizationCode": "code"
}

